IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rra-requisition`

-- Requisition of Resources Act 1985, ss 2, 7, 12, 17, 19 to 21, 23, 27 to 29, 34, 38, 39, 41 to 45 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_requisition-of-resources-act-1985.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 2 -- the 7-day limit without the President`

